OL,3,AThe chef turned award-winning author
OL,4,Aunfazed by 'second book syndrome'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen your award-winning debut novel is
OL,7,Fadapted into a Bafta-nominated TV
OL,8,Fseries expectations run high for what
OL,9,Fmight come next.
OL,11,FBut Louise Kennedy, the author of
OL,12,FTrespasses, seems unfazed with the
OL,13,Fdaunting notion of what is often called
OL,14,Fsecond book syndrome.
OL,16,FMaybe it's her late entrance to the
OL,17,Fliterary world, working in busy
OL,18,Fkitchens as a chef for decades or
OL,19,Fdealing with a cancer diagnosis that
OL,20,Fhelps Kennedy cope with pressure.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
